ら応えようと努力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か熱中できるものが欲しいと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「これは僕が望んでいることなんだ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7121","sourceWorkId":"22393","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"荊の1歳上の幼馴染であり、恋人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日 荊から余命半年であることを告げられ、彼女の頼みで荊のことを忘れようとしていた少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、無機質な毎日を過ごしていた秀だったが、荊が自殺する寸前、再び彼女に寄り添うことを決意する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7121","sourceWorkId":"22899","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"头脑很好，被视为是认真的学生的优等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢被期待，被期待的话会为了回应而努力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"希望找到能让自己投入其中的事物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「这是我的期望！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37532"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1ea4328f978bca2a905cc9959b28a999856641aae48795e58d2fe994754c11e7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eeab35054a7db7fa5127eaa41f323ba18bdcdedb8b2881e3ef03f851110834ea.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c43221","characterName":"城戸崎 荊","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51767","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"167689"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8001"],"vndbCharacterId":"c43221"},"originalCharacterName":"城戸崎 荊","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"秀の1歳下の幼馴染であり、恋人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秀と同じ学園への入学が決まった時に、不治の病に冒されていることが発覚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余命が半年しかない荊は秀に自分のことを忘れるように告げるが、それが原因で廃人のようになった秀を見て、自ら命を絶つことで全てを終わらせようとした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8001","sourceWorkId":"22899","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"秀の1歳下の幼馴染であり、恋人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秀と同じ学園への入学が決まった時に、不治の病に冒されていることが発覚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余命が半年しかない荊は秀に自分のことを忘れるように告げるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それが原因で廃人のようになった秀を見て、自ら命を絶つことで全てを終わらせようとした。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51767"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97759a9b5d78d0978f982e3e15f15a2d73c53023eedb84536d89726773a1efeb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67b1e7927d34b431750be88123d0d6a85d787d5c27eb9505c1437c9f054a5f48.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167689:51767:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2760","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3572","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2760","name":"CYCLET","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:22899:3572","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p12138","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p12138","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p12138","name":"穗见学园汉化组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:103478:v18926","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2760","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2760","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2760","name":"CYCLET","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:51480:v18926","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2760","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2760","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2760","name":"CYCLET","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:61413:v18926","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2760","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2760","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2760","